    "intro_html":  "Chettinad pepper chicken is South India\u0027s answer to bland weeknights: chicken thighs in a dark, pepper-heavy masala that builds heat as you eat. Each bowl delivers \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost), with only 9 grams of fat. Big flavor, lean numbers.",
